  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper evaluates a 9‑qubit quantum reservoir computing model (simulated in Qiskit) for volatility regime change detection on 29 Dow Jones stocks (2015–2020). Using quantum reservoir embeddings with classical readouts, the best result achieved average accuracy 0.923 and precision 0.890, slightly outperforming classical reservoir baselines (~0.895 accuracy) but remaining comparable to strong classical models.",
  "experiments": [
