        },
        "data_preprocessing_details": "Compute expected returns pt, log-scaled returns rt = ln(pt/pt-1), rolling standard deviation over window w=9, normalize rolling volatilities, set threshold tau = mu_tilde_sigma + lambda*sigma_tilde_sigma with lambda=1, derive binary labels ct.",
